The public gauge, Wightman and OPE interfaces and portions of the proof adapters
in PublicTheory.lean, ChallengeSpec.lean, PublicView.lean, WilsonBridge.lean and
HierarchyBridge.lean adapt earlier challenge and solution sources at revision
eea94292e31734d46498be7836d7e8fa50ca8cd2. Changes include the explicit
Wilson limit, geometric Poincaré action, shared spectator hierarchy and the
projection of the detailed construction.

YM/Next/STATIONARY/OneLoop/WilsonVertices.lean, lemma upsurge, uses the
ordered-partition simplification from iteratedDerivWithin_vcomp_three in
Mathlib/Analysis/Calculus/IteratedDeriv/FaaDiBruno.lean. The surrounding
statement and proof apply it to the three-direction Wilson jet.
