YM/Work/F05/PiDensity.lean, private lemma lprodFin, adapts the finite-
coordinate decomposition of integral_fin_nat_prod_eq_prod from
Mathlib/MeasureTheory/Integral/Pi.lean to nonnegative extended-real
lintegrals with explicit measurability hypotheses. The project modification
also uses that result to prove the finite-index and product-density lemmas
lprod and piDensity.
